{
  "$schema_version": "1.0",
  "model": "Users are global. A user gets roles through memberships (user × garage × role × optional branch). Customers and vendors are separate principal types. Implement can(principal, permission, context) in lib/auth/permissions.ts using this file as the single source (import it as JSON). RLS policies enforce tenant isolation; this matrix enforces what a role may do inside a tenant. Unified accounts (Nov 2026): every human has ONE account; garage staff, drivers, vendor members and broker members are all users. Which dashboards they can open is derived from their memberships (lib/accounts/workspaces.ts) and they switch with the workspace switcher.",
